  m_text: "Subject Cheeto.\n\nCongratulations. You have been specifically chosen
    to participate in a highly classified, completely safe, and legally ambiguous
    research initiative involving projectile-based problem solving.\n\nYour objective
    is simple:\nShoot glowing targets.\nDo not shoot non-glowing targets.\nDo not
    ask why some targets are glowing.\n\nIf you experience dizziness, vertigo, existential
    dread, or a sudden awareness that this is all a simulation \u2014 please ignore
    it.\n\nWelcome to the Apert\u2014\n\n\u2026\n\nWelcome to Project Metarrow."
